roublemaker, Claudine; the elegant pianist, Celine; and the class dunce, Mirabel.<br><br>As the autumn months pass, Marcel grows closer to these four girls \u2013 but which one will he develop the strongest bond with? That is up for the reader to decide.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639920/extras/9cad03963e8324a597f1341322fc1908.avif?t=1742937281\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>200,000 words of text (approx 8-12 hours of reading)<br></li><li>Four love interests with wholly unique routes<br></li><li>Detailed character artwork<br></li><li>An entirely original soundtrack<br></li><li>A crossdressing protagonist<br></li><li>Scenic depictions of the French countryside<br></li><li>Happy endings!</li></ul></h2>",
